<header>
  <h1>Eirinchan</h1>
  <div class="subtitle">Installation</div>
</header>

<div class="banner">Initial setup</div>
<div class="blotter">
  Browser installation is disabled. Database configuration is accepted only from the server
  environment and the first administrator must be created from the server console.
</div>

<fieldset class="installer-form">
  <legend>Server administrator</legend>
  <p>Run the database migrations, then create the initial administrator:</p>
  <pre>MIX_ENV=prod mix ecto.migrate
MIX_ENV=prod mix eirinchan.create_admin --username admin</pre>
  <p>The command prompts for the password without echoing it.</p>
</fieldset>
